ientific invocation was not rerun during writing. All plotted numerical data come from the frozen final records in \\\\texttt{paper\\\\_data.json}.\n@@\n-Two development directions do not provide extra measured evidence for the thesis: a count-noise/latent-target extension was not expressible through the scale-only interface and was not implemented; an interaction-tree extension has an unsuccessful evaluation with no measured score and no identified failure cause. Neither is a measured loss or a successful ablation. We do not infer whether the latter failed statistically, operationally, or because of a validity restriction. Development scores are not compared numerically with final scores, and the absence of a matched final ridge-scale baseline remains a limitation.\n+Two development directions do not provide extra measured evidence for the thesis: a count-noise/latent-target extension was not expressible through the scale-only interface and was not implemented; an interaction-tree extension has an unsuccessful evaluation with no measured score and no identified failure cause. Neither is a measured loss or a successful ablation. We do not infer whether the latter failed statistically, operationally, or because of a validity restriction. Development scores are not compared numerically with final scores, and the absence of a matched final ridge-scale baseline remains a limitation.\n+% @evidence[[source_evidence/latent_extension_limitations.md]]\n+% @evidence[[source_evidence/interaction_failure.json]]\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\npython build_claims.py\npython .codex/skills/validate-paper/scripts/validate_tex_refs.py --tex paper.tex --bib references.bib\npython .codex/skills/write-paper-standalone/scripts/validate_claims.py --paper-data paper_data.json --references references_provenance.json --bib references.bib --claims claims_grounding.json --paper-dir .\nPATH=/tmp/paper-tools/bin:\"'$PATH bash .codex/skills/validate-paper/scripts/compile_latex.sh paper.tex > /tmp/compile